# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow works like a Python function that runs on remote compute. Compare a local function with the same code as a workflow:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus berfungsi seperti fungsi Python yang berjalan pada pengiraan jauh. Bandingkan fungsi tempatan dengan kod yang sama sebagai aliran kerja:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`Local Python`**\n"
msgstr "**`Local Python`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In a managed workflow, `run()` is the call, `get_arguments()` gives the workflow its parameters, and `save_result()` is its `return` statement. Because the workflow runs as a separate job on remote compute, it differs from a local function call in three ways:\n"
msgstr "Dalam aliran kerja terurus, `run()` ialah panggilan, `get_arguments()` memberi aliran kerja parameternya, dan `save_result()` ialah pernyataan `return`nya. Oleh sebab aliran kerja berjalan sebagai job berasingan pada pengiraan jauh, ia berbeza daripada panggilan fungsi tempatan dalam tiga cara:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The client encodes arguments and results.** Each value must be one that the client can encode, and some types change. See [Read arguments in your workflow](#read-arguments-in-your-workflow).\n"
msgstr "**Klien mengekod argumen dan hasil.** Setiap nilai mestilah nilai yang boleh dikodkan oleh klien, dan sesetengah jenis berubah. Lihat [Baca argumen dalam aliran kerja anda](#read-arguments-in-your-workflow).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The call does not wait.** `run()` returns a job immediately, and you read the result later with `job.result()`. See [Save results](#save-results).\n"
msgstr "**Panggilan tidak menunggu.** `run()` mengembalikan job serta-merta, dan anda membaca hasil kemudian dengan `job.result()`. Lihat [Simpan hasil](#save-results).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Nothing checks the call.** A Python function rejects an unknown keyword argument, but a workflow ignores it unless you attach a schema. See [Best practice: validate arguments with a schema](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"
msgstr "**Tiada apa-apa yang menyemak panggilan.** Fungsi Python menolak argumen kata kunci yang tidak dikenali, tetapi aliran kerja mengabaikannya melainkan anda melampirkan skema. Lihat [Amalan terbaik: sahkan argumen dengan skema](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Your local notebook, run_workflow_remotely.ipynb, calls run(args). A workflow runs an optional schema check, then creates the managed workflow job, source_files/my_workflow.py. The job reads its arguments with get_arguments(), runs your code, such as mapping, transpiling circuits, running primitives, and post-processing, and returns a result with save_result(). A workflow stores the result, and your notebook reads it with job.result().](/docs/images/managed-workflows/inputs-outputs.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Your local notebook, run_workflow_remotely.ipynb, calls run(args). A workflow runs an optional schema check, then creates the managed workflow job, source_files/my_workflow.py. The job reads its arguments with get_arguments(), runs your code, such as mapping, transpiling circuits, running primitives, and post-processing, and returns a result with save_result(). A workflow stores the result, and your notebook reads it with job.result().](/docs/images/managed-workflows/inputs-outputs.svg)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read arguments in your workflow {#read-arguments-in-your-workflow}"
msgstr "Baca argumen dalam aliran kerja anda {#read-arguments-in-your-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass inputs to your workflow from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Hantar input ke aliran kerja anda daripada notebook tempatan anda:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To enable this, edit your workflow code to fetch arguments with `get_arguments()`, which returns a dictionary whose keys are the argument names:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membolehkan ini, sunting kod aliran kerja anda untuk mengambil argumen dengan `get_arguments()`, yang mengembalikan kamus yang kuncinya ialah nama argumen:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The dictionary contains only the arguments that the run passed, so use `arguments.get()` with a default value for optional arguments. You can use any argument name except the protected keywords `config` and `function_size`, because `run()` uses these keywords directly. `run()` also rejects `compute_profile`. To choose compute resources, pass `function_size`.\n"
msgstr "Kamus hanya mengandungi argumen yang dihantar oleh larian, jadi gunakan `arguments.get()` dengan nilai lalai untuk argumen pilihan. Anda boleh menggunakan sebarang nama argumen kecuali kata kunci terlindung `config` dan `function_size`, kerana `run()` menggunakan kata kunci ini secara langsung. `run()` juga menolak `compute_profile`. Untuk memilih sumber pengiraan, hantar `function_size`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To read the size that the job runs at, call `get_function_size()` in your workflow code:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membaca saiz yang digunakan job semasa berjalan, panggil `get_function_size()` dalam kod aliran kerja anda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the run does not pass `function_size`, `get_function_size()` returns the workflow's default size. See [Choose a size for each run](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#choose-a-size-for-each-run).\n"
msgstr "Jika larian tidak menghantar `function_size`, `get_function_size()` mengembalikan saiz lalai aliran kerja. Lihat [Pilih saiz untuk setiap larian](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#choose-a-size-for-each-run).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported argument types {#supported-argument-types}"
msgstr "Jenis argumen yang disokong {#supported-argument-types}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each value must be JSON-serializable, or an object that the client can encode, such as a Qiskit circuit or a NumPy array. Because the client encodes each argument before it sends the job and `get_arguments()` decodes it inside the workflow, the workflow receives the original Python object.\n"
msgstr "Setiap nilai mestilah boleh bersiri JSON, atau objek yang boleh dikodkan oleh klien, seperti litar Qiskit atau tatasusunan NumPy. Oleh sebab klien mengekod setiap argumen sebelum menghantar job dan `get_arguments()` menyahkodnya di dalam aliran kerja, aliran kerja menerima objek Python yang asal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The client sends `int`, `float`, `str`, `bool`, `None`, and lists or dictionaries of these unchanged. It encodes other objects, such as a `QuantumCircuit`, a `numpy.ndarray`, or a `complex` number, as a dictionary with a `__type__` tag and a `__value__`. You need this form when you [write an argument schema](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"
msgstr "Klien menghantar `int`, `float`, `str`, `bool`, `None`, dan senarai atau kamus bagi jenis ini tanpa perubahan. Ia mengekod objek lain, seperti `QuantumCircuit`, `numpy.ndarray` atau nombor `complex`, sebagai kamus dengan teg `__type__` dan `__value__`. Anda memerlukan bentuk ini apabila [menulis skema argumen](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because JSON has no equivalent for some types, these types change during encoding. Tuples arrive as lists, dictionary keys arrive as strings, and NumPy integers such as `np.int64` arrive as `int`. If the client cannot encode a value, such as `bytes` or `np.float32`, `run()` raises a `TypeError` and does not create a job.\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab JSON tidak mempunyai setara untuk sesetengah jenis, jenis ini berubah semasa pengekodan. Tuple tiba sebagai senarai, kunci kamus tiba sebagai rentetan, dan integer NumPy seperti `np.int64` tiba sebagai `int`. Jika klien tidak dapat mengekod sesuatu nilai, seperti `bytes` atau `np.float32`, `run()` menimbulkan `TypeError` dan tidak mencipta job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some objects cannot be passed as arguments. For example, pass a backend's name as a string instead of a `Backend` object, and create the backend inside the workflow. See [Run quantum jobs from a workflow](/guides/manage-quantum-classical-workflows).\n"
msgstr "Sesetengah objek tidak boleh dihantar sebagai argumen. Contohnya, hantar nama backend sebagai rentetan dan bukannya objek `Backend`, dan cipta backend di dalam aliran kerja. Lihat [Jalankan job kuantum daripada aliran kerja](/guides/manage-quantum-classical-workflows).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size limits {#size-limits}"
msgstr "Had saiz {#size-limits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The arguments of one run can be up to 32 MB after encoding. For example, one 100-qubit circuit with a depth of 100 encodes to about 39 KB, so a single run can take a batch of about 800 such circuits. For larger inputs, [upload a file](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) and pass its name as an argument.\n"
msgstr "Argumen bagi satu larian boleh mencecah 32 MB selepas pengekodan. Contohnya, satu litar 100-qubit dengan kedalaman 100 dikodkan kepada kira-kira 39 KB, jadi satu larian boleh menerima batch kira-kira 800 litar sedemikian. Untuk input yang lebih besar, [muat naik fail](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) dan hantar namanya sebagai argumen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* REVIEW: 32 MB is MAX_ARGUMENTS_LENGTH_MB, which is checked when the workflow declares a schema. The 50 MB request body limit applies to every run. Confirm the number to publish. */}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save results {#save-results}"
msgstr "Simpan hasil {#save-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `save_result()` at the end of your workflow to return a result to your notebook. Read the result in your notebook with `job.result()`:\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `save_result()` di hujung aliran kerja anda untuk mengembalikan hasil ke notebook anda. Baca hasil dalam notebook anda dengan `job.result()`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To enable this, call `save_result()` in your workflow code:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membolehkan ini, panggil `save_result()` dalam kod aliran kerja anda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`save_result()` encodes the result in the same way that the client encodes arguments, and `job.result()` decodes it. A result can therefore contain the [supported argument types](#supported-argument-types), such as circuits, NumPy arrays, and the result of a primitive job, with the same type changes.\n"
msgstr "`save_result()` mengekod hasil dengan cara yang sama klien mengekod argumen, dan `job.result()` menyahkodnya. Oleh itu, hasil boleh mengandungi [jenis argumen yang disokong](#supported-argument-types), seperti litar, tatasusunan NumPy dan hasil job primitif, dengan perubahan jenis yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Check the return value.** If `save_result()` cannot encode the value, it logs a warning and returns `False` instead of raising an error. Without a check, the job can end with the `DONE` status and no result.\n"
msgstr "**Semak nilai pulangan.** Jika `save_result()` tidak dapat mengekod nilai itu, ia mencatat amaran dan mengembalikan `False` dan bukannya menimbulkan ralat. Tanpa semakan, job boleh berakhir dengan status `DONE` dan tanpa hasil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Only the last `save_result()` is stored.** Each call replaces the saved result. To return several values, save them in one dictionary, or write them to the logs.\n"
msgstr "**Hanya `save_result()` yang terakhir disimpan.** Setiap panggilan menggantikan hasil yang disimpan. Untuk mengembalikan beberapa nilai, simpan dalam satu kamus, atau tulis ke log.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**An empty dictionary means no result.** If the workflow never calls `save_result()`, `job.result()` returns `{}`.\n"
msgstr "**Kamus kosong bermakna tiada hasil.** Jika aliran kerja tidak pernah memanggil `save_result()`, `job.result()` mengembalikan `{}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To return files, such as large arrays or plots, save them to [file storage](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) and return their names in the result.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengembalikan fail, seperti tatasusunan besar atau plot, simpan dalam [storan fail](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) dan kembalikan namanya dalam hasil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practice: validate arguments with a schema {#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema}"
msgstr "Amalan terbaik: sahkan argumen dengan skema {#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a best practice, attach a [JSON Schema](https://json-schema.org/) to every workflow that takes arguments. The schema describes the arguments that the workflow accepts, and the workflow checks the arguments of every run against it before it creates the job. If the arguments do not match, `run()` fails immediately with an error that names the bad field, and the workflow does not create a job. Without a schema, bad arguments reach the workflow after the job starts, and the workflow ignores a misspelled argument name.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai amalan terbaik, lampirkan [JSON Schema](https://json-schema.org/) pada setiap aliran kerja yang menerima argumen. Skema menerangkan argumen yang diterima aliran kerja, dan aliran kerja menyemak argumen setiap larian terhadapnya sebelum mencipta job. Jika argumen tidak sepadan, `run()` gagal serta-merta dengan ralat yang menamakan medan yang salah, dan aliran kerja tidak mencipta job. Tanpa skema, argumen yang salah sampai ke aliran kerja selepas job bermula, dan aliran kerja mengabaikan nama argumen yang salah eja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the schema with `arguments_schema` when you upload the workflow. Pass a dictionary, not a JSON string:\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan skema dengan `arguments_schema` apabila anda memuat naik aliran kerja. Hantar kamus, bukan rentetan JSON:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep the following points in mind when you write a schema:\n"
msgstr "Ingat perkara berikut apabila anda menulis skema:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Describe the encoded form of Qiskit and NumPy objects.** The schema checks the arguments as the client sends them, so a circuit is an object such as `{\"__type__\": \"QuantumCircuit\", \"__value__\": \"<base64-encoded QPY>\"}`, not a string or an array. Check the `__type__` tag, and treat `__value__` as an opaque string. A schema that describes a circuit as a string rejects every valid run.\n"
msgstr "**Terangkan bentuk terkod bagi objek Qiskit dan NumPy.** Skema menyemak argumen seperti yang dihantar oleh klien, jadi litar ialah objek seperti `{\"__type__\": \"QuantumCircuit\", \"__value__\": \"<base64-encoded QPY>\"}`, bukan rentetan atau tatasusunan. Semak teg `__type__`, dan anggap `__value__` sebagai rentetan legap. Skema yang menerangkan litar sebagai rentetan menolak setiap larian yang sah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Set `\"additionalProperties\": false`.** Without this setting, the workflow ignores a misspelled argument name, such as `shotz`, without a warning, and runs with its default value. Declare every argument that the workflow accepts before you enable this setting.\n"
msgstr "**Tetapkan `\"additionalProperties\": false`.** Tanpa tetapan ini, aliran kerja mengabaikan nama argumen yang salah eja, seperti `shotz`, tanpa amaran, dan berjalan dengan nilai lalainya. Isytiharkan setiap argumen yang diterima aliran kerja sebelum anda mendayakan tetapan ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Mark arguments as required.** Add each argument that the workflow reads without a default value to `required`.\n"
msgstr "**Tandakan argumen sebagai wajib.** Tambahkan setiap argumen yang dibaca aliran kerja tanpa nilai lalai ke dalam `required`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the arguments do not match the schema, the error message names the rule and the location of the bad value:\n"
msgstr "Jika argumen tidak sepadan dengan skema, mesej ralat menamakan peraturan dan lokasi nilai yang salah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A schema checks the type, shape, and range of each argument. A schema cannot check whether two valid arguments conflict, or whether a circuit fits a backend. Keep those checks in the workflow code.\n"
msgstr "Skema menyemak jenis, bentuk dan julat setiap argumen. Skema tidak dapat menyemak sama ada dua argumen yang sah saling bercanggah, atau sama ada litar muat pada backend. Simpan semakan itu dalam kod aliran kerja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update or remove a schema {#update-or-remove-a-schema}"
msgstr "Kemas kini atau alih keluar skema {#update-or-remove-a-schema}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To replace the schema, set a new `arguments_schema` and upload the workflow again.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggantikan skema, tetapkan `arguments_schema` baharu dan muat naik aliran kerja sekali lagi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove the schema, upload the workflow with `arguments_schema={}`.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengalih keluar skema, muat naik aliran kerja dengan `arguments_schema={}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you upload the workflow without `arguments_schema`, the workflow keeps the stored schema.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda memuat naik aliran kerja tanpa `arguments_schema`, aliran kerja mengekalkan skema yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the schema that is in effect, read `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. A value of `None` means that the workflow has no schema.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat skema yang berkuat kuasa, baca `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. Nilai `None` bermakna aliran kerja tiada skema.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check arguments before you run {#check-arguments-before-you-run}"
msgstr "Semak argumen sebelum anda menjalankan {#check-arguments-before-you-run}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call `validate_arguments()` to check a set of arguments against the schema without starting a job:\n"
msgstr "Panggil `validate_arguments()` untuk menyemak satu set argumen terhadap skema tanpa memulakan job:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the arguments are not valid, `validate_arguments()` raises a `QiskitServerlessException` with the same message that `run()` returns for those arguments. If the workflow has no schema, any arguments are valid. A valid result does not guarantee that `run()` succeeds, because `run()` also checks other limits, such as the number of active jobs.\n"
msgstr "Jika argumen tidak sah, `validate_arguments()` menimbulkan `QiskitServerlessException` dengan mesej yang sama seperti yang dikembalikan `run()` untuk argumen tersebut. Jika aliran kerja tiada skema, sebarang argumen adalah sah. Hasil yang sah tidak menjamin `run()` berjaya, kerana `run()` juga menyemak had lain, seperti bilangan job aktif.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schema rules {#schema-rules}"
msgstr "Peraturan skema {#schema-rules}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow rejects the upload if the schema breaks any of the following rules:\n"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus menolak muat naik jika skema melanggar mana-mana peraturan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The schema can be up to 64 KiB, with up to 64 levels of nesting and up to 200 subschemas.\n"
msgstr "Skema boleh sehingga 64 KiB, dengan sehingga 64 tahap sarang dan sehingga 200 subskema.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "References must point inside the same schema, such as `#/$defs/circuit`, and every reference must resolve. References to URLs or files are not allowed.\n"
msgstr "Rujukan mestilah menunjuk ke dalam skema yang sama, seperti `#/$defs/circuit`, dan setiap rujukan mesti dapat diselesaikan. Rujukan kepada URL atau fail tidak dibenarkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The schema must be an object or a boolean.\n"
msgstr "Skema mestilah objek atau boolean.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Also avoid the following problems, which the upload does not catch:\n"
msgstr "Elakkan juga masalah berikut, yang tidak dikesan oleh muat naik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Nested quantifiers in `pattern`.** A pattern such as `^(a+)+$` can take a very long time to evaluate. A workflow stops validation after a CPU time limit and rejects the run. Write patterns without a quantifier around a group that already contains one, such as `^ibm_[a-z0-9_]{1,40}$`.\n"
msgstr "**Pengkuantiti bersarang dalam `pattern`.** Corak seperti `^(a+)+$` boleh mengambil masa yang sangat lama untuk dinilai. Aliran kerja menghentikan pengesahan selepas had masa CPU dan menolak larian. Tulis corak tanpa pengkuantiti di sekeliling kumpulan yang sudah mengandunginya, seperti `^ibm_[a-z0-9_]{1,40}$`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`false` as a schema.** The schema `false` rejects every run. To remove validation, use `{}`.\n"
msgstr "**`false` sebagai skema.** Skema `false` menolak setiap larian. Untuk mengalih keluar pengesahan, gunakan `{}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot a schema {#troubleshoot-a-schema}"
msgstr "Selesaikan masalah skema {#troubleshoot-a-schema}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| Every run is rejected on a circuit argument. | The schema describes the circuit as a string or an array. Describe it as an object with a `__type__` tag. |\n"
"| Valid runs are rejected. | `additionalProperties` is `false`, and the schema does not declare an argument that the run passes. The error `path` names the argument. |\n"
"| Invalid runs are not rejected. | The workflow has no schema. Check `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. |\n"
"| No run is checked, although you set a schema. | The schema was passed as a JSON string. Pass a dictionary. |\n"
"| The upload fails with a `400` error. | The schema breaks one of the [schema rules](#schema-rules). |\n"
"| The error says that validation took too much CPU time. | A `pattern` has nested quantifiers. Rewrite the pattern. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah | Punca |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| Setiap larian ditolak pada argumen litar. | Skema menerangkan litar sebagai rentetan atau tatasusunan. Terangkan ia sebagai objek dengan teg `__type__`. |\n"
"| Larian yang sah ditolak. | `additionalProperties` ialah `false`, dan skema tidak mengisytiharkan argumen yang dihantar oleh larian. `path` ralat menamakan argumen itu. |\n"
"| Larian yang tidak sah tidak ditolak. | Aliran kerja tiada skema. Semak `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. |\n"
"| Tiada larian disemak, walaupun anda menetapkan skema. | Skema dihantar sebagai rentetan JSON. Hantar kamus. |\n"
"| Muat naik gagal dengan ralat `400`. | Skema melanggar salah satu [peraturan skema](#schema-rules). |\n"
"| Ralat menyatakan bahawa pengesahan mengambil terlalu banyak masa CPU. | `pattern` mempunyai pengkuantiti bersarang. Tulis semula corak itu. |\n"
